EC2 → Volumes → select the new volume → Actions → Attach volume

Select your new EC2.

Now:

New EC2
 ├── New Root EBS
 │     └── New OS
 │
 └── Restored EBS
       └── Old data

Then log into the EC2 and mount the restored volume.

